{
  "name": "theme",
  "title": "主题与深色模式",
  "titleEn": "Theme",
  "category": "foundation",
  "summary": "四种外观模式（按系统 / 按时间 / 浅色 / 深色）、防闪烁脚本与设计变量覆盖。",
  "when": "所有页面。只需在 <head> 放防闪烁脚本，Riko 会自动应用保存的模式。",
  "root": null,
  "js": {
    "attr": "",
    "options": [],
    "methods": [
      {
        "signature": "Riko.theme.set(\"system\" | \"time\" | \"light\" | \"dark\")",
        "desc": "设置并保存模式"
      },
      {
        "signature": "Riko.theme.toggle()",
        "desc": "浅/深切换"
      },
      {
        "signature": "Riko.theme.mode",
        "desc": "当前模式"
      },
      {
        "signature": "Riko.theme.current",
        "desc": "实际主题 'light' | 'dark'"
      },
      {
        "signature": "Riko.theme.onChange(fn)",
        "desc": "订阅变化"
      },
      {
        "signature": "Riko.theme.configure({ storageKey, dayStart, dayEnd })",
        "desc": "配置"
      },
      {
        "signature": "Riko.themeInitSnippet(storageKey?)",
        "desc": "返回防闪烁脚本源码（服务端渲染时内联）"
      }
    ],
    "events": [
      {
        "name": "riko:theme:change",
        "detail": "{ mode, theme }",
        "desc": "在 document 上派发"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rules": [
    "<html data-theme=\"dark\"> 即深色；局部区域也可写 data-theme=\"dark\" / \"light\" 强制主题。",
    "自定义品牌色：在你的 CSS 中覆盖 --riko-palette-* 或 --riko-color-*（写在 :root, [data-theme] 与 [data-theme=\"dark\"] 两处）。",
    "防闪烁：在 <head>、样式表之前放 <script src=\".../dist/riko-theme-init.js\"></script>（推荐）；服务端渲染时也可把 Riko.themeInitSnippet() 的返回值内联。"
  ],
  "avoid": [
    "不要写 @media (prefers-color-scheme) 自己切颜色，统一用 data-theme。"
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "局部深色区域",
      "html": "<section data-theme=\"dark\" style=\"background: var(--riko-color-bg); color: var(--riko-color-fg);\">…</section>"
    },
    {
      "title": "覆盖品牌色",
      "html": "<style>\n  :root, [data-theme] { --riko-palette-star: #E98A9B; --riko-palette-star-soft: #FBE1E6; }\n</style>"
    }
  ],
  "related": [
    "theme-picker"
  ]
}